    <item>
      <title>Version 2.0.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:05:00 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>A brand-new design with a sidebar: Home, Shortcuts, Activity, Settings and About</li>
          <li>English interface: switch between Arabic and English from Settings</li>
          <li>Activity: your conversion stats, saved only on your Mac</li>
          <li>Change the shortcut inside the app, with a warning if macOS already uses it</li>
          <li>Optional quiet sound, and switching the keyboard to the right language after converting</li>
          <li>Light, Dark or System appearance, and a resizable window</li>
          <li>With nothing selected, Hawwel now asks you to select the text first</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/ashrafabdulmn3m/Hawwel/releases/download/macos-v2.0.0/Hawwel-2.0.0.dmg"
